### 🛡️ Validation & Resilience
- **Smart Validator**: Updated [validate.py](file:///home/nithin/devops_agent/src/engine/validate.py) to automatically look for binaries in `./bin`. 
- **Constitutional Rules**: Added built-in structural checks to catch common LLM failures (missing `FROM`, missing `ARG GIT_SHA`, apiVersion issues) even if external tools like `hadolint` are not present.
- **Repair Loop Integration**: Integrated the surgical healing loop into the [V2Orchestrator](file:///home/nithin/devops_agent/src/decision_engine/orchestrator.py). The agent will now automatically attempt to fix validation errors before presenting the results to you.

### 📝 Production Hardening
